---
// Source: Campaign Operating Manual, Chapter 3 — Why TECHMED Exists.
---

<section class="section">
  <h2>Why TECHMED Exists</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Nigeria has no shortage of tutorial centres. Students can already find
    questions, notes, videos, past questions. Yet thousands remain confused —
    not because information is scarce, but because structure is scarce.
  </p>

  <div class="problems">
    <p class="problems-label">Students often experience:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Information overload</li>
      <li>Poor planning</li>
      <li>Inconsistent study habits</li>
      <li>Lack of accountability</li>
      <li>Isolation</li>
      <li>Fear-based preparation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p class="close">
    TECHMED exists to solve those problems. We believe preparation should
    not begin with more information. It should begin with better systems.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-24) var(--space-6);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .problems {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .problems-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .problems ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .problems li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    padding-left: var(--space-4);
